[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3306940000","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110560#issuecomment-3306940000","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110560","id":3306940000,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FG-Zg","user":{"login":"Scraprogrammer","id":204466156,"node_id":"U_kgDODC_n7A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204466156?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scraprogrammer","html_url":"https://github.com/Scraprogrammer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scraprogrammer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scraprogrammer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scraprogrammer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scraprogrammer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scraprogrammer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scraprogrammer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scraprogrammer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scraprogrammer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scraprogrammer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-18T11:27:11Z","updated_at":"2025-09-18T11:27:11Z","body":"After update to 4.5 and export to Android 14 device with shader baker enabled, I noticed a behavior difference in loading time when the game is launched for the first time, which might be related to this.\n\nBefore update:\n- Start game - wait for ~ 2-3 seconds for first scene to load.\n- Open a scene with a lot of entities that use shaders - wait for ~1 second for scene to load.\n\nAfter update:\n- Start game - wait for ~ 0.5 seconds for first scene to appear.\n- Open a scene with a lot of entities that use shaders - wait for ~2-3 seconds for scene to load.\n\nI'm still pretty new to Godot and shaders, but I would have expected those 2-3 seconds to disappear after the update with shader baker enabled. Could it be that even with shader baker export the game still compiles shader during runtime? Or maybe I'm overlooking something simple...\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3306940000/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3308080929","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110560#issuecomment-3308080929","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110560","id":3308080929,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FLU8h","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-18T15:18:59Z","updated_at":"2025-09-18T15:19:10Z","body":"@Scraprogrammer Which rendering method are you using? The shader baker only affects projects using Forward+ and Mobile, not Compatibility.\n\nAlso, the shader baker can't bake everything in advance. Certain shaders may only be known at runtime, and will still be compiled at runtime. I suggest going through the [Reducing stutter from shader (pipeline) compilations](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/performance/pipeline_compilations.html) documentation.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3308080929/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3310864987","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110560#issuecomment-3310864987","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110560","id":3310864987,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FV8pb","user":{"login":"Scraprogrammer","id":204466156,"node_id":"U_kgDODC_n7A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204466156?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scraprogrammer","html_url":"https://github.com/Scraprogrammer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scraprogrammer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scraprogrammer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scraprogrammer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scraprogrammer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scraprogrammer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scraprogrammer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scraprogrammer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scraprogrammer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scraprogrammer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-19T06:58:21Z","updated_at":"2025-09-19T06:58:21Z","body":"I'm using Mobile. And Thanks f