uilds on other Macs w/o a previous installation I am experiencing very long launch times with the first launch of my game. \n\nPrevious dev builds yielded much faster launch times with first launch on other Mac w/o previous installations.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3325253429/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3325703923","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110560#issuecomment-3325703923","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110560","id":3325703923,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GOjbz","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-23T22:09:58Z","updated_at":"2025-09-23T22:09:58Z","body":"> Previous dev builds yielded much faster launch times with first launch on other Mac w/o previous installations.\n\nCould you test all 4.5 dev/beta builds to check when the regression started? You can download them [here](https://godotengine.org/download/archive/). Knowing when the regression started will greatly speed up bisecting, so we can resolve the issue faster.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3325703923/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3328505737","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110560#issuecomment-3328505737","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110560","id":3328505737,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GZPeJ","user":{"login":"another-ascii","id":5232154,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMzIxNTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5232154?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii","html_url":"https://github.com/another-ascii","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-24T13:39:00Z","updated_at":"2025-09-24T13:39:00Z","body":"I will try my best. My time is somewhat limited so it'll be at least a couple of days until I can provide an answer.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3328505737/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3328668021","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110560#issuecomment-3328668021","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110560","id":3328668021,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GZ3F1","user":{"login":"another-ascii","id":5232154,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMzIxNTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5232154?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii","html_url":"https://github.com/another-ascii","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-24T14:03:07Z","updated_at":"2025-09-24T14:03:07Z","body":"I've been doing a bit of digging in the filesystem in ~/.godot/exported folder.\n\nBelow is a list of the exports I have made for the same project across different beta, rc and stable versions of 4.5. As you can see there is a sudden drop in cache size between rc1 and rc2. This without the project changing w/regards to use of shaders.\n\nMy thought was that the difference in cache sizes across versions could be an indicator of when the issue was introduced. \n\nCache sizes per export per\nJul. 30th - 4.5-beta4 - 258MB\nAug. 7th - 4.5-beta5 - 277MB\nAug. 22nd - 4.5-beta6 - 268MB\nSep. 4th - 4.5-beta7 - 268MB\nSep. 8th - 4.5-rc1 - 263MB\nSep. 11th - 4.5-rc2 - 97MB\nSep. 16th - 4.5-stable 97MB\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3328668021/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3329934382","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110560#issuecomment-3329934382","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110560","id":3329934382,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GesQu","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-24T17:18:18Z","updated_at":"2025-09-24T17:18:18Z","body":"@another-ascii I think export size might be a red herring. The only relevant change in RC2 was https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110264 which only impacts MacOS devices. However, the OP of this issue is on Windows","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3329934382/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3330213703","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110560#issuecomment-3330213703","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110560","id":3330213703,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GfwdH","user":{"login":"another-ascii","id":5232154,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMzIxNTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5232154?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii","html_url":"https://github.com/another-ascii","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/another-ascii/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-24T18:44:01Z","updated_at":"2025-09-24T18:44:01Z","body":"I have tested OS.has_feature(\"shader_baker”) on all dev, beta and rc versions of 4.5 for the result of OS.has_feature(\"shader_baker”) now.  The results are that the call consistently returns false.\n\nI have done so on a minimum viable project: a 3D scene with a Node3D; script attached with a simple if / else that prints the result of calling OS.has_feature(\"shader_baker”)\n\nResults per release:\n4.5.dev1 - false (shader baker n/a)\n4.5.dev2 - false (shader baker n/a)\n4.5.dev3 - false (shader baker n/a)\n4.5.dev4 -  false (shader baker introduced)\n4.5.dev5 - false\n4.5.beta1 - false\n4.5.beta2 - false\n4.5.beta3 - false \n4.5.beta4 - false\n4.5.beta5 - false\n4.5.rc1 - false\n4.5.rc2 - false\n\nFurther - my apologies if I am muddying the waters. My observation has been regarding what I perceive to be changes in the behavior of the shader baker when testing my game across different devices: when first introduced I noticed fast launch times w/shader baker enabled. With later versions not so. I realize that this might be an entirely different issue. Again - sorry if this aspect is not contributing to this issue.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3330213703/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3330230390","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110560#issuecomment-3330230390","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110560","id":3330230390,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Gf0h2","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/